{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " ἀλλά, Conj., orig. neut. pl. of ἄλλος, otheruise: used adversatively to limit or oppose words, sentences, or clauses, stronger than δέ: in simple oppositions, but, after neg. clauses, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐ κακός, ἀλλ' ἀγαθός Thgn. 212", "author_abbreviation": "Thgn.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδὲ μὲν Ἕκτωρ μίμνεν, ἀλλ' . . ἐφορμᾶται Il. 15.690", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. after a simple neg., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἦ παραφρονεῖς; οὔκ, ἀλλ' ὕπνος μ' ἔχει Ar. V. 9", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. freq. after οὐ μόνον, μὴ μόνον, with or without "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καί, οὐ μόνον ἅπαξ, ἀ. πολλάκις Pl. Phdr. 228a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 3.59", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Mem. 1.4.13", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; without "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μόνον, οὐχ ἑσπέρας, ἀλλὰ καὶ μεσημβρίας E. Fr. 1006", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": also after οὐχ (or μὴ( ὅτι, οὐχ (or μὴ) ὅπως, either, not only . . but . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μὴ ὅτι ἰδιώτην τινά, ἀλλὰ τὸν μέγαν βασιλέα Pl. Ap. 40d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μὴ ὅτι κατὰ τὸ σῶμα, ἀλλὰ καὶ κατὰ τὴν ψυχήν Id. Smp. 207e", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; or, not only not . . but . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐχ ὅπως κωλυταὶ . . γενήσεσθε, ἀλλὰ καὶ . . περιόψεσθε Th. 1.35", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐχ ὅτι ὠργίζοντο, ἀλλ' ἐζήλουν D. 19.265", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; the neg. form is ἀλλ' οὐδέ, μὴ ὅτι ὑπὲρ ἄλλου, ἀλλ' οὐδὲ ὑπὲρ ἐμαυτοῦ "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δίκην εἴρηκα Is. 10.1", "author_abbreviation": "Is.", "tlg_author": "0017", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. in the apodosis of hypothetical sentences, still, at least, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἴπερ γάρ τε . . ἀλλά τε Il. 1.82", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: in Prose, esp. ἀλλ' οὖν . . γε or "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀλλά . . γε, εἰ καὶ σμικρά, ἀ. οὖν ἴση γε ἡ χάρις Hdt. 3.140", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; εἰ μή (sc. ὁρῶ), ἀλλ' ἀκούω γε, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Grg. 470d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Isoc. 3.15", "author_abbreviation": "Isoc.", "tlg_author": "0010", "tlg_work": "014", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ",al.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰ μηδέν ἐστι τελευτήσαντι, ἀλλ' οὖν τοῦτόν γε τὸν χρόνον ἧττον ἀηδὴς ἔσομαι Pl. Phd. 91b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (in later Gk. ἀλλά γε may be in juxtaposition, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰ ἄλλοις οὐκ εἰμὶ ἀπόστολος, ἀλλά γε ὑμῖν εἰμί 1 Ep.Cor. 9.2", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", and ἀ. γε δή is found with vv. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il.", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Phdr. 262a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "); εἰ καὶ μετέχουσι . . ἀλλ' οὐ . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arist. Pol. 1282a11", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "035", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—less freq. after Conjunctions of Time, as "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπεὶ δή Od. 14.151", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπεί S. OC 241", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". after "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", ἀ. is used elliptically, esp. with Advbs. of Time, ὦ θεοὶ πατρῷοι, συγγένεσθέ γ' ἀ. νῦν (sc. εἰ μὴ πρότερον, ἀ. νῦν γε) "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. El. 411", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ant. 552", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Heracl. 565", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀ. τῷ χρόνῳ Id. Med. 912", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐὰν οὖν ἀ. νῦν γ' ἔτι, i.e. ἐὰν οὖν [μὴἄλλοτε], ἀ. νῦν γε . . if then now at least ye still . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 3.33", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lys. 10.15", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—without an Adv. of Time, at least, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡ δ' ἀ. πρός σε μικρὸν εἰπάτω μόνον Ar. Pax 660", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OC 1276", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. HF 331", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". sts.= ἀλλ' ἤ (q.v.), except, but, οὔτι μοι αἴτιος ἄλλος, ἀ . . . τοκῆε no one else, but . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 8.312", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδέ τις ἄλλη φαίνετο γαιάων, ἀ. οὐρανὸς ἠδὲ θάλασσα 12.404", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔπαισεν οὔτις ἀ. ἐγώ S. OT 1331", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡδέα . . οὐκ ἔστιν ἀ. τούτοις Arist. EN 1176a22", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1152b30", "autho